@* Waiting, said in the text itself: `shimmer` sweeps a highlight through the glyphs, which is
   shadcn's own treatment for a marker that is thinking. This demo used animate-pulse for months
   because the shimmer utility did not exist here yet — it does now, and this page is where it
   is documented. *@
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
    <Marker>
        <MarkerIcon><Icon Name="loader-circle" Class="size-3 animate-spin" /></MarkerIcon>
        <MarkerContent Class="shimmer">Thinking…</MarkerContent>
    </Marker>
    <Marker Variant="border"><MarkerContent Class="shimmer">Reading 4 files</MarkerContent></Marker>
</div>
